WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.262
PRIYA: Bhaiya, Cyber Hub. Nine thirty. Please. Meter se.

2
00:00:19.881 --> 00:00:23.737
DEV: Bhaiya, Cyber Hub. Nine thirty-ish. Jo bhi.

3
00:00:23.967 --> 00:00:26.600
PRIYA: Excuse me, maine pehle roka.

4
00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:29.769
DEV: Aapne roka. Main baith gaya. Democracy.

5
00:00:30.399 --> 00:00:35.465
BABLU: Dono baitho. Ek hi jagah, ek hi interview, ek hi kismat.

6
00:00:35.815 --> 00:00:38.727
PRIYA: Aapko kaise pata ek hi interview?

7
00:00:38.777 --> 00:00:44.414
BABLU: Tees saal se yahi chala raha hoon. Sab ek hi interview mein jaate hain.

8
00:00:47.244 --> 00:00:48.926
BABLU: Meter down.

9
00:00:58.756 --> 00:01:00.774
PRIYA: Yeh... yeh kya tha?

10
00:01:00.464 --> 00:01:02.315
BABLU: Shortcut liya.

11
00:01:02.945 --> 00:01:05.669
DEV: Bhaiya, yeh Cyber Hub nahi hai.

12
00:01:05.711 --> 00:01:11.397
BABLU: Cyber Hub abhi bana nahi. Isiliye traffic bhi nahi. Soch ke dekho.

13
00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:14.471
PRIYA: Mera interview nine thirty hai!

14
00:01:14.351 --> 00:01:20.525
BABLU: Kaunsa nine thirty, madam? Nine thirty roz aata hai. Tees saal se aa raha hai.

15
00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:24.796
DEV: Chole kulche abhi bhi garam hain. Main theek hoon.

16
00:01:26.865 --> 00:01:30.236
PRIYA: Woh kutta. Woh wahi kutta hai jo abhi tha.

17
00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:33.564
BABLU: Tommy. Woh kahin nahi jaata. Hum jaate hain.

18
00:01:35.318 --> 00:01:39.806
PRIYA: Ek sau saintees rupaye pachaas paise? Hum kahin gaye hi nahi!

19
00:01:39.497 --> 00:01:44.714
BABLU: Gaye hain. Unnatees saal. Meter saal nahi ginta. Paise ginta hai.

20
00:01:47.844 --> 00:01:51.509
DEV: Bhaiya, aage chalo, bachcha judge kar raha hai.

21
00:01:51.435 --> 00:01:53.117
BABLU: Meter down.

22
00:02:00.497 --> 00:02:03.409
DEV: Ab toh Cyber Hub ban gaya hoga.

23
00:02:03.639 --> 00:02:05.127
PRIYA: Chai. Hub.

24
00:02:05.336 --> 00:02:08.118
BABLU: Interview hai. Company nahi hai.

25
00:02:08.432 --> 00:02:10.156
DEV: Toh job pakki.

26
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:16.572
PRIYA: Bhaiya. Please. Nine thirty. Kisi bhi saal ka.

27
00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:20.523
BABLU: Chalenge. Pehle meter. Ek sau saintees pachaas. Exact.

28
00:02:23.953 --> 00:02:30.596
BABLU: Paanch sau ka chhutta do hazaar saintalees mein? UPI unnees sau sattanave mein?

29
00:02:30.946 --> 00:02:32.375
DEV: Toh phir?

30
00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:35.573
BABLU: Toh jab tak chhutta nahi, meter down.

31
00:02:44.603 --> 00:02:46.915
BABLU: Waiting charge alag hai.
